[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_wu4hb"]
script = ExtResource("16_e1bml")
raw_dialogue = "So our world created the champions from its cries.
They were Giratran the artist and Kryona the wise.
They shaped a new land, powered by that foreign stone,
and so our world moved and escaped that fiery fate alone."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ckkcqb8nkpgwn"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_esrjc"]
script = ExtResource("16_e1bml")
raw_dialogue = "For three hundred years our world was content.
free from death, physics and boredom its years were spent
But one fateful day, Kryona made a discovery so malign:
That holy crystal was losing its holy shine."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ckkcqb8nkpgwn"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_iypm4"]
script = ExtResource("16_e1bml")
raw_dialogue = "Now all the migrants and newborn, inheritors of this land
Look in agony as the clock ticks forward to its end
Kryona tried her best to keep that fate at bay
And in the process turned the colours bland and grey
Tick, tock the time goes forward
Tick, tock the end comes closer
Tick, tock…"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ckkcqb8nkpgwn"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_2yw4r"]
script = ExtResource("16_e1bml")
raw_dialogue = "Dear Diary
I don’t understand why everyone here loves forests and water so much. It’s so boring!!! I want more cool sci-fi stuff!!! Luckily Giratran made this little place for me. Kryona got so mad…

Player: Hope you are doing well, Havyo"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ckkcqb8nkpgwn"

